WEBVTT

00:06:28.829 --> 00:06:30.913
I am a creative person.

00:06:30.913 --> 00:06:34.079
When I feel anxious or uncertain,

00:06:34.079 --> 00:06:35.288
I can stop,

00:06:36.246 --> 00:06:37.746
breathe,

00:06:37.746 --> 00:06:39.329
observe

00:06:39.329 --> 00:06:41.121
and use my imagination.

00:06:41.954 --> 00:06:44.163
Let's look at the first part
of that statement:

00:06:44.163 --> 00:06:45.746
I am a creative person.

00:06:46.329 --> 00:06:47.704
Many of us have been taught

00:06:47.704 --> 00:06:50.371
that creativity is a talent
only some of us have,

00:06:50.413 --> 00:06:53.663
a skill reserved for artists,

00:06:53.704 --> 00:06:55.746
inventors, big thinkers,

00:06:56.579 --> 00:07:00.329
that it's not something for regular people
with quote, unquote real jobs.